Subject: [PATCH] POC-18k: stop tracking the play log (committed by mistake in
 POC-14g); ignore the game's runtime files

Playing appended to the tracked pkbn_playlog.jsonl, leaving the host tree dirty so setup_host.sh refused to run.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FbWSqvcg6G5Gpw6ynvR5tJ
---
 .gitignore         | 4 ++++
 pkbn_playlog.jsonl | 3 ---
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 pkbn_playlog.jsonl

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index 43ef2cc..17d8f32 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -47,3 +47,7 @@ prefabs.json
 /pokeemerald_modern-*.png
 include/pkbn/bn6_gfx_data.h
 pkbn_replay.bin
+pkbn_playlog.jsonl
+pkbn_log.txt
+pkbn.sav
+pkbn.sav.*
diff --git a/pkbn_playlog.jsonl b/pkbn_playlog.jsonl
deleted file mode 100644
index af5c294..0000000
--- a/pkbn_playlog.jsonl
+++ /dev/null
